[{"answer":"Hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Um... my family and I are staying here in Trebirch for a week or two","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and we wanted to know about the train services.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/3.mp3"},{"answer":"We're hoping to do a few local trips.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I can give you lots of details about all the trains going from Trebirch in the South West.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/6.mp3"},{"answer":"This leaflet will be very helpful","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/7.mp3"},{"answer":"but I can tell you some of the main things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/8.mp3"},{"answer":"We've got two main train stations in the town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/9.mp3"},{"answer":"King Street is for local commuter lines and regional services.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/10.mp3"},{"answer":"What about trains to London?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll need to go there on business for one day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you need to go to Central Station -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/13.mp3"},{"answer":"that's for all the national services.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/14.mp3"},{"answer":"There are regular trains to London.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/15.mp3"},{"answer":"They leave Trebirch every half hour on weekdays and every hour at weekends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It takes about two hours, a bit longer on Sundays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/17.mp3"},{"answer":"You've got a choice of first and second class and there's a buffet car -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/18.mp3"},{"answer":"though refreshments are included in the cost of a first class ticket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, and have you got any information on different ticket types?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/22.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a range of ticket prices depending on when you travel and when you buy your ticket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/23.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a standard open ticket which doesn't have any restrictions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/24.mp3"},{"answer":"This can be bought in advance or on the day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/25.mp3"},{"answer":"You can also get various discounted tickets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/26.mp3"},{"answer":"A popular one is called the Supersave","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/27.mp3"},{"answer":"and, er, this is OK for travel after 8.45.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there is the Special ticket,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/29.mp3"},{"answer":"which is valid for travel after 10:15.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/30.mp3"},{"answer":"The Special tickets are also valid for travel at weekends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/31.mp3"},{"answer":"The cheapest tickets are called Advance","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/32.mp3"},{"answer":"and you have to buy them at least six days ahead.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Only a certain number are available","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and you have to make seat reservations for these.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks. And are there lots of places to go to around here?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/37.mp3"},{"answer":"You can enjoy many days out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Um there's the Merthyr Mining Museum,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/39.mp3"},{"answer":"which is only half an hour from Trebirch by train.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Your children will find it just as fascinating as any theme park","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/41.mp3"},{"answer":"and they can ride in the original miners' lifts and on the coal trains.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/42.mp3"},{"answer":"There are special excursion tickets which include entrance fees.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Mainline trains also offer direct services to Bristol,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/44.mp3"},{"answer":"where you can visit the docks or spend a great day out with the children in the zoo,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/45.mp3"},{"answer":"which is set in the parkland that used to surround the old castle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, special family awayday fares are available for this service now during the school holidays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, alternatively, you can be in Birmingham in only an hour and a half,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/48.mp3"},{"answer":"where there's lots to see and do including the new and internationally-acclaimed climbing wall","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/49.mp3"},{"answer":"built on the site of the old aquarium.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/50.mp3"},{"answer":"We will also be running a special service to Newport","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/51.mp3"},{"answer":"when the new science museum opens next year,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/52.mp3"},{"answer":"as we anticipate a lot of visitors in the opening weeks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd advise you to call early to book your tickets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that OK?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-2-2023-08-02-09-32-33/56.mp3"}]
